---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Series
permalink: /series/index.html
description: "Explore the book series from Roaring Kids Press."
---
<div class="wrap page-head">
  <p class="label">Our worlds</p>
  <h1>Series</h1>
  <p class="hero-lede">Each series follows one character across many books, so young readers get to grow up with a friend they know by heart.</p>
</div>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:1rem;">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="series-grid">
      {% for s in seriesList %}
      <a class="series-card" href="/series/{{ s.slug }}/" style="--accent: {{ s.accent }};">
        <span class="ages">Ages {{ s.ages }} · {{ s.brand }} series</span>
        <h3>{{ s.name }}</h3>
        <p>{{ s.blurb }}</p>
        <span class="more">Explore the series →</span>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
